  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 517.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 517.01 Applicability. This part shall apply to the construction and maintenance of trails, boardwalks, and paths in jurisdictional areas used to provide access for outdoor recreational pursuits including but not limited to snowmobiling as defined in RSA 215-C:1, XV and off-highway recreational vehicle use as defined in RSA 215-A:1, VI.\n\nSource. #12805, eff 12-15-19; ss by #13124, eff 10-23-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt500.html"
}
